OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies manslaughter after
OL,4,Afatal dog bite
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose dog fatally bit another man
OL,7,Fin West Yorkshire has denied
OL,8,Fmanslaughter.
OL,10,FJames Judge, 55, died after an incident
OL,11,Fon the old train line footpath off
OL,12,FBlacker Lane in Wakefield on August 15.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday, 55-year-old Lee Ellis, of
OL,15,FCalder Grove in Wakefield, appeared at
OL,16,FLeeds Crown Court where he pleaded not
OL,17,Fguilty to manslaughter and being in
OL,18,Fcharge of a dog dangerously out of
OL,19,Fcontrol causing injury resulting in
OL,20,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
